######## J4 (reduction along s(X), n = 4; own bookkeeping; F3/F4 inputs taken as given) ########
  [True] vertical traces: tr G_0 = (9 + 1/(1-4 lam))/c_V, |tau|^2 = 4/(c_V(1-4 lam)) (explicit 10x10 Gram)
  [True] F inputs consistent: trace of the F3/F4(c) Ricci blocks equals s_Y of F3/F4(b), in Z1 and Z2
     Z1: G^Y = (-(8*Lambda_g*c_V*lambda - 2*Lambda_g*c_V - 45*c_H*lambda + 12*c_H)/(2*c_H*c_V*(4*lambda - 1))) h + (-(16*Lambda_g*c_V*lambda - 4*Lambda_g*c_V - 35*c_H*lambda + 10*c_H)/(2*c_H*(4*lambda - 1))) G_0 + ((32*Lambda_g*c_V*lambda**2 - 8*Lambda_g*c_V*lambda - 90*c_H*lambda**2 + 29*c_H*lambda - c_H)/(4*c_H*(4*lambda - 1))) tau tau;  beta = -1/(2*c_V*(4*lambda - 1))
     Z2: G^Y = (-(2*Lambda_g*c_V - 9*c_H)/(2*c_H*c_V)) h + (-(4*Lambda_g*c_V - 7*c_H)/(2*c_H)) G_0 + ((8*Lambda_g*c_V*lambda - 18*c_H*lambda + c_H)/(4*c_H)) tau tau;  beta = 0
  [True] Z1 beta = 1/(2 c_V (1 - 4 lam)) from II of F4(a); Z2 beta = 0
     Z1: rho = (5*lambda - 1)/(c_V*(4*lambda - 1));  Theta = -3*(15*lambda - 2)/(2*c_V*(4*lambda - 1)) + (-11/c_H) Lambda_g
     Z2: rho = 1/c_V;  Theta = -9/(2*c_V) + (-11/c_H) Lambda_g
  [True] J4(b) balance identity [h] - [G_0]/c_V: x_i (Lambda_g/c_H + rho) = sum H_i,phi (beta a_phi - p_phi/c_V), identity in generic Sigma, dSigma, l and b (Z1, Z2)
  [True] J4(b) rho_Z2 = 1/c_V, rho_Z1 = (5 lam - 1)/(c_V (4 lam - 1))
  [True] J4(c) a = 0 branch: c_i = x_i Theta, sum H p = x_i (G_G0 - c_V G_h), sum H q = x_i (G_tt + lam c_V G_h) is the unique solution (generic Sigma, l, b)
  [True] J4(c) Theta = Theta_0 - (11/c_H) Lambda_g with Theta_0(Z2) = -9/(2c_V), Theta_0(Z1) = 3(2-15lam)/(2c_V(4lam-1)); Theta_0(Z1, 1/5) = 15/(2c_V)
  [True] J4(c) at the F6 point (Z1, lam = 1/5, Lambda_g = 0): G^Y = (15/(2c_V)) g_aleph and the p, q right-hand sides vanish
  [True] J4(e) radial Z1 at a = 0: Lambda_g = c_H (1 - 5 lam)/(c_V (4 lam - 1)), zero exactly at lam = 1/5
  [True] (14,0) J4(c) image condition exact: every column of l_E is (x,y) up to a multiple of (xz + yw), so im H(t,u) is contained in span(x,y) whenever det H_0 = 0 (not only at leading order)
  [True] (7,7) J4(c) image condition exact: every column of l_E is (x,y) up to a multiple of (xz - yw), so im H(t,u) is contained in span(x,y) whenever det H_0 = 0 (not only at leading order)
  [True] (14,0) J4(d) Shiab# real form: e1 = ks + 312s^2 + 104r^2 on r(k+208s) = 0; e1 >= -k^2/1248; det M = k^2(k+224s)(k+544s) on r = 0 (nonzero for s >= -k/624, k > 0): a = 0 branch gives exactly [c_H/11 (Theta_0 - k^2/1248), oo)
  [True] (7,7) J4(d) Shiab#: curve u(k+208t) = 0; det M = k^2(k+224t)(k+544t) on u = 0, = v^2+554/13 k^2 v+21/169 k^4 > 0 on t = -k/208; c1 covers [-k^2/1248, oo) (t >= -k/624, det M != 0) and (-oo, k^2/416]: every real Lambda_g

X4b J4 beyond the a = 0 branch (ansatz (J) with a_phi != 0)
  [True] J4, a != 0: the six equations reduce to c_i = x_i Theta + 13 beta (H a)_i - |tau|^2 B_i(alpha) (dSigma drops out); exact identity test at 4 random rational points per metric (Z1, Z2), generic Sigma, dSigma, l, b
